// ── Local signing setup (one-time, per developer) ───────────────────────────
// 1. Copy this file to "Local.xcconfig" in the same folder (the repo root).
//    Terminal:  cp Local.xcconfig.example Local.xcconfig
// 2. Put YOUR own Apple Developer Team ID below.
// 3. Re-open Xcode (or run `xcodegen generate`) and build.
//
// Local.xcconfig is gitignored, so your team ID never overwrites a teammate's.
//
// Find your Team ID:
//   • Xcode ▸ Settings… ▸ Accounts ▸ select your Apple ID ▸ the 10-char ID in parentheses, or
//   • Terminal:  security find-identity -v -p codesigning   (the (XXXXXXXXXX) part)
//
// Note: only the owner of the iCloud container (iCloud.com.bpjsr.skibidi) can run the CloudKit
// features on a real device. Everyone else builds & runs on the Simulator just fine.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
